siriushq/openbsd_src
====================

The OpenBSD project produces a free, multi-platform UNIX-like
operating system, based on NetBSD 1.0, based on 4.4-BSD.

This repository hosts a mirror of the source code, available in the
`upstream` branch, retrieved from the official Git mirror of the CVS
repository, tracking `master`.  There are several guides for
developers and users, the formatted guide is available at:

	https://www.openbsd.org/faq/
